---
title: "TIMEMORE — Nano Manual Coffee Grinder"
description: "A compact hand grinder with a foldable handle and a stainless steel conical burr, built to pack small."
date: "2026-10-27"
tags: ["grinder", "hand grinder"]
brand: "TIMEMORE"
category: "Hand grinder"
---

This is the one I'd grab for a trip. The handle folds down against the body, so it slips into a bag without the crank poking at everything else. It's small, so it holds less coffee than a full-size grinder, but for one cup at a time that doesn't matter.

Good for pour over, AeroPress and French press. Read more in [my hand grinder post](/coffee/reviews/hand-coffee-grinders).
